#!name=Proxy-Extra
#!desc=Personal domains forced through CF Edge Auto
#!updated=2026-09-11

# Prefer DOMAIN-SUFFIX for a service-owned domain and DOMAIN for a shared host.
# Do not add broad shared CDNs such as amazonaws.com or cloudfront.net.
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,example.com
# DOMAIN,api.example.net

# Exchanges (service-owned domains include their API/WebSocket subdomains).
# Backpack API: https://docs.backpack.exchange/
